1
00:00:00,103 --> 00:00:04,368
A Day in a Coastal Village A multitude of visitors gathered on

2
00:00:04,382 --> 00:00:07,526
the fringe of the village as milky light spread across the bay

3
00:00:08,434 --> 00:00:11,697
Boats moved to and fro and a path along the hill's flank

4
00:00:11,711 --> 00:00:16,197
led to the shore The morning seemed pacific yet a notice warned

5
00:00:16,211 --> 00:00:20,882
us to beware of changing weather At noon a swell appeared offshore

6
00:00:21,789 --> 00:00:25,895
Guides asked people to disperse except for a group waiting under shelter

7
00:00:26,803 --> 00:00:32,539
One visitor called the precaution senseless Presumably he expected calm weather to

8
00:00:32,553 --> 00:00:37,974
last on the contrary the guide had received an updated forecast We

9
00:00:37,987 --> 00:00:42,250
went indoors to hear local history Our host used plague to mean

10
00:00:42,263 --> 00:00:47,684
a recurring problem not a current illness The story helped kindle curiosity

11
00:00:48,592 --> 00:00:54,118
A frightful event showed how people could perish without community support Responsible

12
00:00:54,132 --> 00:00:57,092
travel begins with listening to people who know a place
